TO SELBB
CC CCE/RAS/ASG/BBG

Subject  Load Up Request for NHS Sector Trade

It's acknowledged that maiden voyage of NHS sector sales is scheduled to be from VVD HNQT0109W (ETD KRKAN NOV 22nd )
To date, after checking booking status of NHS maiden voyage today  , it's found below facts

Findings
-Bkg situation for main destination is quite strong  overally 112% , especially for VNSGN/SGSIN destined cargo
-Bkg for sector trade is extremely as low as 23% ,  KRPUS/CNSHA   bkg 10 TEU   KRPUS/CNSHU 13 TEU (1*F4 total 12 TEU )
Requirement to SELBB
-Take immediate sales action to induce as much more as volume for sector trade
-Update  newly developed customer list for our reference in sector region (account name , volume ,commodity)
-Do your best to  arrange  volume onto NHS VVD HNQT0109W (ETD KRKAN NOV 22nd )  even in limited lead time

